Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.00,0:03:59.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《狂蟒之灾4：血路斑驳》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,最新的血清结果超出预期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The latest serum has surpassed expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,测试目标接受血清后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The test subject has grown five times normal size…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,数日内就长到正常的五倍大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…within days of the serum being introduced into its system.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一已知的副作用是攻击行为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the only known side effect is aggressive behaviour…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要持续喂食 以维持较高的新陈代谢率{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that requires constant feeding to maintain a higher metabolic rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.76,0:01:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前 目标需要保持镇静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now, constant sedation of the subject is needed…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.10,0:01:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过结果是大有可为的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but the results are very promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一种状况会再生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regeneration only occurs…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.02,0:01:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是在受伤部位立即注入血清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when there is immediate introduction of the serum into the wounded area.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.51,0:01:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过去尝试挽救老旧已分解…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My past attempts to save older decomposed…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.64,0:01:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,或严重受损的组织都失败了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or severely damaged tissue have failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:03:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,血兰花最新的基因改造{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The latest genetic modifications to the black-orchid strain…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.44,0:03:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对血清萃取液有预期性的效果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have had the predicted effect on the serum extract.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清现在成功提供显著效益{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The serum now successfully provides the apparent benefit…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂停活组织的分解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of halting decomposition of living tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.05,0:03:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只要适当应用的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, of course, would rev olutionise medicine…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在医学上会有革命性的进展{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if properly applied.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫达克先生在等您 这边请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Murdoch is expecting you. Right this way, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.83,0:05:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 打扰您 尤金先生到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, sorry to disturb you. Mr. Eugene has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.37,0:05:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请他进来 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Send him in. - Right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,您好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.52,0:05:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有只手提箱 打开看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a briefcase over there. Have a look inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里是一百万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's $1 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一个小忙 钱就是你的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's yours if you'll do a little job for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在听 - 坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm listening. - Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这儿不远的森林里有间木屋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a cottage in a forest not far from here…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的员工在那里做实验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where an employee of mine has been conducting certain experiments…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验结果可能对我的健康有利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the outcome of which may be beneficial to my health.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.39,0:05:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.15,0:06:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟他失联了 他似乎失踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost contact with him. He appears to have disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.23,0:06:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他实验成功了吗？ - 我相信是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His experiments were successful? - I believe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他创造了新品种的血兰花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe he created a new hybrid of the blood orchid…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,从中萃取血清 血清奏效了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…extracted a serum from it, and that the serum works.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他闹失踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why he's gone missing…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他找到别的老板了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because he has found another employer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你去收回植栽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I want you to collect all the plant material…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清和他所有的研究笔记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the serum, all his research notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到他并干掉他 - 就他一个人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Find him and kill him. - Just one man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.39,0:06:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要提醒你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should warn you…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.59,0:06:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说他是地球上最聪明的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that some say he's one of the smartest men on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能有几把刷子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may have one or two tricks up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.16,0:06:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多钱只杀一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a lot of money for one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.77,0:06:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这项计划我投资了五千万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have invested over $50 million in this project…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,收益无可估计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the returns could be incalculable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不计代价我都要得到结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want results no matter what the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片上的女孩也有参与计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a photo of a girl in there who is also involved with the project.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道的太多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.33,0:07:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是她碍手碍脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should she cross your path…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.73,0:07:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就除掉她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…remove her from the equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意之至{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.67,0:07:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,正合我意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I wanted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.58,0:07:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间非常重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time is of the essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有骨癌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have bone cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有这杯小东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without this little concoction…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.99,0:07:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活不到下个礼拜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I would be dead within the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.86,0:07:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的血清会有所改变？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that new serum might change that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.40,0:07:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is my hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:08:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I see you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.71,0:08:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路顺风{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.25,0:08:12.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（喀尔巴阡山 东欧）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.34,0:09:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我怎么看得懂啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the heck am I supposed to read this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.13,0:10:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.17,0:10:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迷路了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 他们是警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, it's okay, we're… They're officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞不清楚方向 地图写的是罗马尼亚文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got a little turned around. The map's in Romanian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.25,0:10:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到那里有东西 很大的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I saw something out there. Something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:10:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 是看到还是听到？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you see it or hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.29,0:10:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你跟着我们吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, why don't you just stick with us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.76,0:11:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会来这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's your story?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.03,0:11:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我暑假来陪祖母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spend the summers with my grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她住在附近的小镇 你们都是警察？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lives in a town nearby. Are you guys all cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是 我研究花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not. I study flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.41,0:11:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,花？让两个警察陪你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flowers? And you have two cops with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.98,0:11:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想研究古病理学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm studying for a career in palaeopathology.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.89,0:11:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇上的人告诉我 这片山区有在做考古挖掘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People in town told me there was a dig going on in these mountains…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.39,0:11:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想去看一看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so I wanted to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.09,0:11:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 古什么学？ - 研究古人类遗骸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Palaeo what? - The study of human ancient remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.89,0:11:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我朋友也不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's okay, my friends don't understand it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听到了吗？ - 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You hear that? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,森林静悄悄的就表示附近有掠食动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the forest goes quiet, there's a predator near.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 你当真？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字？ - 艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your name again? - Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.01,0:11:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿曼达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:12:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真不应该独自来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you really shouldn't be out here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.22,0:12:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.49,0:12:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我们太暴露了 快去找掩护吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you guys, we're too exposed. We need to take cover. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和那个跩博士在这个考古地点工作 他去休假了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm working this dig with this hotshot Ph. D. Who's on sabbatical.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始吹嘘他的新方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he starts yapping to me about his new methodology…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还说他发明了工具让他挖得更快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and how he's developed a tool that allows him to dig faster…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.81,0:12:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不会损害到文物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…without damaging any artefacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还告诉我我们的方法是史前方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also tells me the way we do it is prehistoric…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人都不那样做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and nobody does it that way anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以我还没说完 - 「我还没说完」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So I'm not done yet. - "I'm not done yet."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这位跩博士把我拉到考古现场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hotshot, he drags me over to his site.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.99,0:12:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跳下洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hops down in the hole…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.49,0:12:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当场用他的新工具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and he immediately proceeds to chop off two of his fingers…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断了自己的两根手指头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with this brand-new tool of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这故事有点恐怖 杰克森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a bit of a morbid story there, Jackson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己也吓了一跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a little shocked myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有问他是不是 要把那些手指留在现场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did ask if he was gonna leave fingers…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.27,0:12:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让未来的人去发掘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for future generations to uncover.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:12:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是嫉妒他抢先你一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were jealous he could out-dig you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我不清楚 但他数到三比我快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know about that, but he can count to three faster than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.48,0:13:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家专心点 我们就快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on, guys, let's focus. We're not too far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们所言属实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if what they say is true…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是欧陆最重要的发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this could be one of the most important discoveries on the continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗兰 有没有你哥或第一组的消息？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roland, any news on your brother or Team 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没有半点消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, haven't heard anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,海瑟 音乐不错听喔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather, nice tunes, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, man. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.01,0:13:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忍不住 我是节奏的奴隶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help it. I am a slave to the rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是节奏的奴隶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a slave to the rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想脱衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna take my clothes off. I wanna…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想抚摸你的身体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna touch your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.61,0:14:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 这是我们最不需要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. That's the last thing we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有路可以绕道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any way around it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.78,0:14:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看看 - 有人带链锯吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me look. - Anyone pack a chain saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.22,0:14:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以用石凿 - 在这儿待好几天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, we can use the rock chisels. - Yeah, and we'd be here for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 只有这条路通往大本营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, this is the only route to the base camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以走山路吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we go off-road?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们可以走山路 不过大概回不来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we could go off. We're not gonna get back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.87,0:14:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 这样吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's break it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.91,0:14:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天没有第一组的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't heard from Team 1 in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这根木头看来他们没有通过这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the looks of this log, they didn't come through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.28,0:14:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有无线电 手机收不到讯号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had no radio, no cell-phone communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 猜猜看 我们要用走的 - 你疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guess what, guys. We're walking. - Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克森 有五英里耶 - 我们用走的 海瑟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jackson, it's five miles, man. - We're walking, Heather.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.99,0:14:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 大家听好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿背包轻装便行 我们去找第一组{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your packs and travel light. We'll get to Team 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上我们再回来用器材搬开这棵树{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the morning, we'll come back, use the equipment to move this tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.33,0:15:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克森 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jackson. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.77,0:15:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何不先走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you head out now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿齐了设备再赶上去跟你会合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll hunt the rest of the gear and we'll meet you halfway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.81,0:15:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天很快就黑了 - 那就动作快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's getting dark pretty fast. - Well, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.45,0:15:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你们看到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.49,0:15:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.23,0:15:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你眼花了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, your eyes are playing tricks on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 路可远着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. It's been a long drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.97,0:15:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿杰克森吉普车上剩下的设备吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the rest of the gear out of Jackson's Jeep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 我们去看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Alex, let's go check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瓦席里 你们留在这儿 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vasile, you guys stay out here. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.59,0:16:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要手电筒吗？ - 我有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want a flashlight? - I've got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 真不敢相信他办到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, I can't believe he did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.07,0:16:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.91,0:16:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不懂 我一直在找这些花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't understand. I've been looking for these flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,混种花 效力可能有两倍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hybrids, probably twice the potency.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.42,0:16:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会用这个吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, you know how to use this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.36,0:16:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那只是风声吧？ - 也许是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was just the wind, right? - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.77,0:16:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么？ - 不要问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell are you doing? - Don't ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.64,0:16:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要炸掉这个地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna blow this place up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会用那种东西吗？ - 我知道自己在干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know how to use that stuff? - I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸掉这些花希望就能做个了结{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put an end to these flowers, hopefully, I'll put an end to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.02,0:17:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 了结什么？ - 你怎么来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An end to what? - How'd you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.72,0:17:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开吉普车 干嘛？ - 我们会需要它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Jeep, why? - We'll need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.39,0:17:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要离开一百码我才能炸掉这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gotta get about a 100 yards before I blow this place…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.40,0:17:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 走我前面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move. Get in front of me. Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.67,0:17:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你朋友怎么办？ - 他们可能都死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about your friends? - They're probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿曼达 这是怎么回事？ - 总之…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amanda, what the hell is going on? - Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂 继续走就对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea. Just keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走 我就在你后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going, kid. I'm right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪了？ - 就在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where the hell were you? - Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 找到出口了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, there's a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.11,0:19:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.75,0:19:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.55,0:19:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我去找救兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I'll get help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.52,0:20:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,森林静悄悄的就表示附近有掠食动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the forest goes quiet, there's a predator near.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.25,0:20:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.32,0:20:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈啰？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.52,0:21:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈啰？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.70,0:21:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.85,0:21:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anybody here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.59,0:22:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克森呢？ - 可能迷路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where the hell is Jackson? - Probably lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.82,0:22:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他迷路我就宰了他 - 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll kill him if he is. - Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.59,0:22:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干嘛？ - 我看到动静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I've got movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.19,0:22:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪？ - 那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.40,0:22:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.23,0:22:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我过去看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm gonna check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有带枪？ - 我跟你去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You brought a gun? - I'll come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.87,0:22:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要做傻事 - 放心吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do anything stupid. - Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.11,0:22:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是去查看一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just gonna check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.89,0:22:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么？ - 是我 杰克森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing, man? - Hey, it's Jackson, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.16,0:22:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克森 - 杰克森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jackson. - Jackson.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么了？ - 怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to you? - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.80,0:22:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 他们死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong? - They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.43,0:22:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁死了？ - 什么意思 死了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's dead? - What do you mean, dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.44,0:22:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁死了？ - 第一组都死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's dead? - Team 1. They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.74,0:22:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, we've gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.31,0:23:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底是谁死了？ - 什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's dead exactly? - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.38,0:23:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没停下来检查钱包 总之凶手还在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't stop and check their wallets. Whatever killed them is still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.15,0:23:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧 - 冷静点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. We gotta go. - Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.18,0:23:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太远了 我们去大本营 - 他们就死在大本营！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're too far. Let's get to base camp. - They are dead at base camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.96,0:23:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冷静五秒钟好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you calm down five seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.49,0:23:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们太深入了 我们要去大本营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're too far in. We'll get to base camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.99,0:23:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们至少会有他们的车还有卫星电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the least, we'll get their vehicles, get a satellite phone…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.26,0:23:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,做紧急广播{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and send out an emergency broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.53,0:23:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你错了 - 我是对的 我们太深入了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're wrong. - I'm right. We're too far in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.80,0:23:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走吧 - 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now let's move. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.17,0:23:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.77,0:23:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 快啊 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家不要走散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.35,0:24:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家听好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的目标 彼得和阿曼达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the targets: Peter, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.06,0:24:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛尔 快点过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sal, join the club. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.86,0:24:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在附近的木屋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in a cottage near here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.57,0:24:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到他 拿到我们要找的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find him, we get what we're looking for…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.00,0:24:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就清掉房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we clean house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.27,0:24:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被列为「见到就杀」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is classified "shoot on sight."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.04,0:24:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真浪费 - 确实是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What a waste. - Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.51,0:24:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 照我的话去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful, do as I say…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.61,0:24:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的话我们天亮前就可以出森林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and with any luck, we'll be out of the forest by daybreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.05,0:24:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.62,0:24:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们有伴了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we've got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.86,0:25:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少是一天前升的火 - 他们的尸体不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This fire's at least a day old. - They're gone. The bodies are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.60,0:25:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有遗失东西 - 那是好事 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's nothing missing. - That's a good thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.60,0:25:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许吧 - 见鬼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe. - Like hell it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.57,0:25:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.54,0:25:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天这里本来有尸体 我亲眼看到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were bodies here today. I saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.38,0:25:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么就是不信呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what about that is not sinking in with you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.15,0:25:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克森 没人说你没看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson, nobody's saying you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.45,0:25:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道第一组可能运尸体去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all we know, Team 1 could've been transporting the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.62,0:25:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.42,0:25:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不着所有人都去运送{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wouldn't take the whole group to take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.32,0:25:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,总会有人在这里 他们不会出去工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody would be here. They're not out working.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.79,0:25:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道 他们没有夜间工作的设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't have equipment to work at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.03,0:25:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在哪里？ - 那我们就去找他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are they, huh? Where? - Then we have to go looking for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.83,0:25:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 考古现场在山上 - 我们会去 不过等天亮再去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The site is up that hill. - And we will, but not until sunup.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.33,0:25:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚不行 我们迷路对他们没好处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not tonight. We'll be no good to them if we get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.74,0:25:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我自己去 - 你要去 大家就一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go alone. - You go, we all go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.57,0:25:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.17,0:25:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果外头有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is something out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.04,0:25:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上它可能会比较占优势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…chances are, it'll have the advantage at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.78,0:25:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 今晚为了保险起见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- True. - Tonight we all play it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.65,0:25:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家住一间小屋 轮流站岗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stay in one hut, and we rotate lookouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.59,0:26:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我有看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.76,0:27:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.56,0:27:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.63,0:28:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 你吓到我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - You scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.20,0:28:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我看到外面有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I saw something out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.57,0:28:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪？ - 不知道 那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - I don't know, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.91,0:28:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定有听到声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be hearing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.74,0:28:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有看到什么东西吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.65,0:28:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我知道我应该留在屋里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I know, I know. I should have stayed inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.92,0:28:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.13,0:28:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这里是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know what's going on here…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.66,0:28:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道我今天看到了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I know what I saw today.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.00,0:29:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有预感明天会在考古现场发现什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got a pretty good idea of what we're gonna find at the site tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.01,0:29:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望你变成那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want you to be a part of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.64,0:29:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我要你跟温迪开车回镇上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow I want you and Wendy to take the van and go back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.05,0:29:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 为什么？因为我们是女生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, why? Because we're girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.18,0:29:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是因为你们是女生 这不是什么竞赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, not because you're girls. Listen, this isn't some kind of contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.45,0:29:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 但是… - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, but… - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.89,0:29:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望你出事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want anything to happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.99,0:29:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太在乎你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I care about you too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.51,0:29:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,再提醒我一次 我们为何非得保密不可？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind me again, why do we have to keep this a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.01,0:29:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？不用保密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.85,0:29:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用 对吧？ - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't, right? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.15,0:29:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 有东西咬我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Something bit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.85,0:29:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有东西咬我 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something bit me. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.66,0:29:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有东西叮了你 - 会刺痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, man, something nailed you. - It stings.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.03,0:30:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？ - 还好 只是会刺痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah, it just stings.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.86,0:30:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们进去找东西把它拿出来 - 好 把它清出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go in and get something on that. - Yes, clean it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.30,0:30:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,会是什么？你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it? You got any idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.44,0:30:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.54,0:30:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.06,0:31:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.43,0:31:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.64,0:31:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.69,0:31:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 真不敢相信他逃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, I can't believe he did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.29,0:32:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.83,0:32:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.70,0:32:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.70,0:32:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so good, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.14,0:32:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 来什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's do this. - Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.01,0:32:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,海瑟 你被游民蜘蛛咬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather, you were bitten by a hobo spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.81,0:32:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们有毒 但不会致命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're poisonous, but they're not deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.15,0:32:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好痛 - 我知道 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, it hurts. - I know it does, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.32,0:32:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是会过去的 我保证 - 对 最好是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it'll pass, I promise. - Yeah, well, it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.66,0:32:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,考古现场到处是毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The area around the bite is filled with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.50,0:32:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要切开小伤口把毒放出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make a tiny incision to drain it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.21,0:33:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样会让你更快退烧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll make your fever drop much quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.38,0:33:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道你在干嘛吧？ - 知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what you're doing, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.01,0:33:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道自己在干嘛 - 准备好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know what I'm doing. - You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.48,0:33:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I'll ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.79,0:33:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.86,0:33:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.49,0:33:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.50,0:33:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.74,0:33:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.14,0:33:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺住 不要动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hang on, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.81,0:33:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 放轻松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.25,0:33:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.06,0:33:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要乱动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold still, hold still, hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.90,0:33:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, it's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.68,0:34:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.78,0:34:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没事 亲爱的 - 谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's fine, honey. - Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.58,0:34:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有咖啡吗？ - 没有 你可以喝我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got a cup of coffee? - No, but you can have mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.99,0:34:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真好 干杯 - 哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, you're a doll. Cheers. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.59,0:34:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.47,0:34:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去挖掘现场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we're gonna go to the excavation site…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.94,0:34:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能找到人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…see if we can find anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.70,0:34:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,温迪会留下来陪你 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy's gonna stay here with you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.71,0:34:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.14,0:34:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个无线电留给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna leave this radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.64,0:34:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有事找我就打来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you need to talk to me for any reason, you call, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.88,0:34:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在三号频道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on channel three.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.72,0:34:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.89,0:34:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意你的体温{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep an eye on your temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.72,0:34:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过102度就打给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it goes above a 102, you're gonna call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.46,0:35:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 放心吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll be fine. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.70,0:35:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要打给我喔？ - 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna call me, right? - Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.60,0:35:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在外面小心点 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you be careful out there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.51,0:35:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.19,0:35:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道会发现什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what we're gonna find…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.83,0:35:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会做好最坏的打算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I'd be prepared for the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.23,0:35:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 看在罗兰的份上 我希望你是错的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. For Roland's sake, I hope you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.35,0:35:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.53,0:36:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,温迪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.27,0:36:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,温迪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.91,0:36:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下可好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.16,0:37:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,温迪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.20,0:37:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,考古现场应该就在右手边某个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The site should be just over there to the right somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.17,0:37:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是哪来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.84,0:37:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 地图吗？ - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, the map? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.87,0:38:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在其中一间木屋找到的 肯定是第一组做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it in one of the huts. Team 1 must have made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.18,0:38:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不远了对吧？ - 应该是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not much further, right? - Shouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.88,0:38:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你担心你哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you're worried about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.39,0:38:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望我能上帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wish there was something I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.99,0:38:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事 他出事我会有感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's okay. I would feel it if he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.82,0:38:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗兰、杰克森 快过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roland, Jackson, get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.45,0:38:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 杰克森！史考特！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Jackson! Scott!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.33,0:38:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.48,0:40:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来呀 你这条臭蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you big bag of slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.55,0:42:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.27,0:42:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跑！它在你后面！ - 我知道 快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run! It's behind you! - I know. Go. Run, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.85,0:42:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听到没有？ - 听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you hear that? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.09,0:42:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那边传来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came from somewhere over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.69,0:42:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗兰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roland.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.00,0:42:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out, move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.61,0:43:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想前面有块空地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I think there's a clearing up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.72,0:43:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞什么… - 那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Son of a… - What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.66,0:43:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是签约来搞这个的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't sign on for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.20,0:43:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.17,0:43:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个人绝对逃不掉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people are never gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.64,0:43:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得做点什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.31,0:43:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗兰 快回来 - 罗兰 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roland, get back here. - Roland, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.25,0:43:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克森 - 罗兰 回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jackson… - Roland, get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.92,0:43:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克森 不要 - 罗兰！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jackson, no. - Roland!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.65,0:43:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克森 等等！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.65,0:43:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开我 - 罗兰！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God, get off me. - Roland!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.12,0:43:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗兰！ - 退后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roland! - Back, back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.26,0:43:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要过去 你疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't go, don't go. What are you, crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.93,0:43:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快回来啊 - 快点掉头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, get back here. - Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.93,0:43:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗兰！罗兰 不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roland! Roland, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.15,0:44:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.29,0:44:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是阿曼达 干掉她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Amanda. Take her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.36,0:44:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无能为力了 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing we can do. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.53,0:44:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它来了 - 走 快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's coming. - Go, go, run. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.46,0:44:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意儿怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that thing out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.47,0:44:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,它攻击 我们就开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it attacks, we engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.10,0:44:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.74,0:44:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们分开跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, let's split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.94,0:44:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我来 你们走那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you, come with me. You guys go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.74,0:44:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.25,0:45:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,温迪 你去哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez, Wendy, where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.75,0:45:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听到后面有人 - 我也听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I heard somebody back there. - Yeah, I heard somebody too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.75,0:45:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为是你 - 你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought it was you. - Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.72,0:45:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 我刚醒来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine, I just woke up and…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.46,0:45:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪 - 派崔克！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. - Patrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.83,0:45:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.30,0:45:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪 派崔克 - 派崔克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God, Patrick. - Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.13,0:45:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说话 放轻松 别开口 什么都别做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say anything. Just relax. Don't speak, don't try anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.17,0:45:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,想办法绑紧他的伤口 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to tie his wound or something. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.88,0:45:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静点 - 想办法绑紧他的伤口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay calm. - Try and tie his wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.78,0:45:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,海瑟 我们需要史考特 快找史考特 我们需要他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather, we need Scott. Get Scott. We need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.18,0:45:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去找史考特 - 快 现在就需要他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go get Scott. I'll call him. - Hurry, we need him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.12,0:45:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 撑住 我们找人来帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. - Hold on, we're getting help.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.49,0:46:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放轻松 冷静点 - 史考特 这里需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just relax, calm down. - Scott, we need you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.19,0:46:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,派崔克回来了 他受伤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got Patrick here. He's injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.96,0:46:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你 我们没受过这种训练{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you. We're not trained for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.19,0:46:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 派崔克他… 史考特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Patrick… Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.16,0:46:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,史考特 请回答 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott, please come in, please. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.37,0:46:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 我知道它在后面 它来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, he's behind us, I know it. He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.31,0:46:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 我们混淆它 - 我知道它要来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, we'll confuse it. - He's coming, I know he's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.64,0:46:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走左边 我们来混淆它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go left, go left. We'll confuse it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.49,0:46:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等那个女的 她才是目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for the girl. She's the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.86,0:46:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.61,0:46:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.96,0:47:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生辛苦 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life is hard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.73,0:47:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生辛苦 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life is hard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.56,0:47:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 那是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.92,0:47:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去找你朋友 如果你希望他们平安的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends, bring me to them if you want them safe. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.56,0:47:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？有人听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anybody out there? Can anybody read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.46,0:47:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 听到了请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on. Somebody, anybody, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.87,0:47:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完全没响应 - 继续试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not getting anything. - Keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.14,0:47:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在试 他怎么样？ - 不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm trying. How is he? - Bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.67,0:48:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,史考特 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott, please, somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.18,0:48:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can anybody read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.95,0:48:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人听到了吗？ - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there anybody out there? Come on. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.96,0:48:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.83,0:48:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 有人听见吗？ - 这是林业局 你在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, can anyone read me? - Forest Service, what's your location?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.16,0:48:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我收到回应了 - 真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm getting something. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.27,0:48:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在玉米田附近的大本营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're at a base camp near a cornfield or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.53,0:48:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是在这里工作的考古团队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're part of the archaeological team working in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.50,0:48:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要紧急医疗协助… - 温迪！海瑟！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need medical help right away. - Wendy! Heather!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.11,0:48:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克森？你到哪儿去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson? Where the hell were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.18,0:48:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史考特呢？派崔克需要就医 - 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Scott? Pat needs a medic. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.65,0:48:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.42,0:48:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,温迪 拿急救箱给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy, get me the med kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.85,0:48:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在你后面的帐蓬里 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's in the tent right behind you. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.19,0:48:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.43,0:48:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.13,0:48:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我帮你 - 温迪 去找吉普车的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me help you. - Find the keys to the Jeep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.47,0:49:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们送他离开这里 - 好 我去找 马上回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're getting him out of here. - Okay, I can do that. Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.94,0:49:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在这里等 - 我能帮什么忙吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll wait here. - Is there something I can do to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.64,0:49:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.98,0:49:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.58,0:49:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.99,0:49:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫达克家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murdoch residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.46,0:49:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 请稍候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, just a second, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.46,0:49:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫达克先生 尤金在在线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Murdoch, Eugene is on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.56,0:49:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫达克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.00,0:49:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我找到小屋了 - 然后呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I found the cottage. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.00,0:49:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没提到蛇的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't say anything about the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.57,0:49:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过他可能有几把刷子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I told you he might have a few tricks up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.04,0:49:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话言轻了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the understatement of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.11,0:49:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道会遇上这种事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea what we could expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.08,0:49:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千万 干掉那个女的再加一百万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten million, and an extra million for taking out the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.55,0:49:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管那个女的了 你拿到血清了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the girl. Do you have the serum?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.69,0:49:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿到了 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I do. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.62,0:49:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你的人来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your man to meet me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.13,0:50:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会准备好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.77,0:50:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定了 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all set. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.07,0:50:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,温迪 没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy. Wendy, it's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.57,0:50:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史考特来了 他有钥匙 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Scott showed up. He's got the keys. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.74,0:50:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想派崔克稳定了 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think Patrick's stabilised. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.91,0:50:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿了装备就离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's grab our gear and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.05,0:50:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们现在就得离开 快 - 看着我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to leave now, come on. - Look at me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.45,0:50:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.15,0:50:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才见到的东西我要负责 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am responsible for what you saw back there, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.22,0:50:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我们得离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, we've gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.23,0:50:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 相信你？要我相信你？ - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trust you? You want me to trust you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.03,0:50:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们刚才看到什么？ 那是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what we just saw out there? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.80,0:50:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 某种实验？ - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some kind of an experiment? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.07,0:50:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到的那些人是来拿血清的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those men that you saw are here to get the serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.57,0:50:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么血清？ - 他们不能留证人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What serum? - They can't have any witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.81,0:50:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂我说的吗？我们必须离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand? We have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.31,0:50:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们会杀我们？ - 为何不？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They would kill us? - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.85,0:50:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最利落的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the cleanest option.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.82,0:50:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.32,0:51:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.09,0:51:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我的客户似乎有某种价值{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to be of a certain value to my client…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.59,0:51:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以的话我要问你几个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so I'm going to ask you a few questions, if I'm allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.06,0:51:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.93,0:51:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.33,0:51:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找血清 我相信你知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a serum which I'm sure you know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.77,0:51:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.98,0:51:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要浪费时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. Don't waste my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.83,0:51:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我这个人的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.97,0:51:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我没听见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I didn't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.41,0:51:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.64,0:51:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 他是科学家 抓到一条蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. He's a scientist that captured a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.75,0:52:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 他现在人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.52,0:52:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回答问题 - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Answer the question. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.02,0:52:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也在找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking for him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.17,0:52:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.94,0:52:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁他创造的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To destroy everything that he's created.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.75,0:52:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走运 你还没 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for us, you didn't, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.42,0:52:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那个东西在你们会很难拿到血清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna pretty be difficult for you to go get that serum with that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.69,0:52:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？ - 你们要是尝试就会送命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - You guys are gonna die if you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.86,0:52:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然如此 你去帮我们拿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's the case, you are going to go get it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.60,0:52:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我为什么要那样做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Why would I do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.21,0:53:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 派崔克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.68,0:53:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 派崔克！ - 你做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Patrick! - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.25,0:53:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？我是帮他忙 他不用再受苦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I make him a favour. He's not suffering anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.75,0:53:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 温迪 不要！ - 杰克森 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wendy, no! - Jackson, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.09,0:53:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 温迪！ - 温迪 不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wendy! - Wendy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.93,0:53:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要！ - 杰克森 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Jackson, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.93,0:53:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克森 - 只要有机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jackson. - I am gonna kill you…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.97,0:53:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the first chance I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.97,0:53:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克森 不要 - 放开他 我喜欢这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jackson, no. - Let him go. I'm liking this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.07,0:53:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听见没？你死定了 - 杰克森 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You hear me? You are dead. - Jackson, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.21,0:53:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 你… 天哪 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn you, you are… God. God, God, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.84,0:53:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克森 不要 - 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jackson, no. - God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.91,0:53:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.81,0:53:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 你们两个十分钟内离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. You two, 10 minutes. You are leaving in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.59,0:53:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到她说的 那东西会杀了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard what she said. That thing will kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.96,0:53:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧 但相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, but trust me…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.59,0:53:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去的话 你跟你的组员 存活的机率比较大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you and your team's chances of living are better if you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.76,0:53:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会派我的人过去确认你们不会迷路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'll send my men to make sure you don't lose your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.30,0:53:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.77,0:54:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,海瑟…过来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather, Heather, come here, come here, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.17,0:54:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.97,0:54:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, it's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.78,0:54:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, it's okay. Let's go, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.78,0:54:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 拜托跟我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Please, just come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.95,0:54:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪着她让她冷静点 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay with her. Just calm her down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.66,0:54:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我在 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I got you. Come on, we're gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.83,0:54:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.71,0:55:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你们轻装便行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you guys pack light…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.68,0:55:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免我们要快速移动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in case we gotta move fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.38,0:55:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你自己保重 小子 - 我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take care of yourself, kid. - I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.85,0:55:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想我们能摆脱这一切吗？ - 说实话？可能没办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think we'll get away with this? - Truth? Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.06,0:55:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.74,0:55:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.98,0:55:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底在研究什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this research about?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.58,0:56:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真的想知道？ - 对 我真的想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You really wanna know? - Yeah, I really wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.56,0:56:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,长生不老 青春之泉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Longevity, immortality, the fountain of youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.13,0:56:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人拿这种兰花加强其基因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody took this orchid and genetically enhanced it…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.93,0:56:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当做血清的化学基础{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which is the chemical basis for the serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.64,0:56:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,被注射血清的蛇 都能长到正常的一百倍大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any snake that ingests this serum can grow 100 times its normal size.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.68,0:56:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而你在追蛇？ - 摧毁花和研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you were chasing it? - Destroying the flowers and research…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.38,0:56:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我弥补过错的唯一之道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is the only way I could atone for what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.75,0:56:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每天都在等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting every day…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.39,0:56:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我找到这些兰花的任何迹象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for any sign that would lead me to these orchids.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.65,0:56:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就在这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is where they were?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.39,0:56:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始听说奇怪的传言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started hearing strange stories…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.29,0:56:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,说这片山区有人和动物陆续失踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…about these animals and people that were disappearing in these hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.66,0:56:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用想也知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't take a genius to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.53,0:56:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要自己一个人来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why try it by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.90,0:56:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one believed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.64,0:56:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个叫瓦席里的警察跟着我 但是他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had this cop, Vasile, with me, but he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.31,0:57:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.58,0:58:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.21,0:58:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.51,0:58:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他藏在矿井里 在北边半里远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he hid it in the mineshaft, which is about a half a mile north.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.08,0:58:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想冒险吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys wanna chance it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.49,0:58:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇是夜间动物 它们追踪热 外面很黑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snakes are nocturnal. They detect heat. It's pretty dark out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.19,0:58:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你自认幸运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you're feeling lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.80,0:58:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里等到天亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll wait here till sunup.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.57,0:58:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那我们继续找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Then we'll keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.00,0:58:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们究竟要找什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are we looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.11,0:58:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟血清有关的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything that references the serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.72,0:58:47.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（封锁）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.65,0:59:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.18,0:59:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你得吃东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you need to eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.66,0:59:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,海瑟 你看着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather, look at me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.36,0:59:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有机会就离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we get the chance, we're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.50,0:59:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要你保持体力 因为我一个人办不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need you to have your strength because I can't do this by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.83,0:59:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会把你丢在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not leaving you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.07,0:59:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见没有？我不会把你丢在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me? I won't leave you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.15,0:59:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会丢下你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.34,1:00:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有结果吗？ - 没有 都是无聊的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything? - No, it's all boring.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.88,1:00:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在窗边放了炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just rigged an explosive to the window.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.82,1:00:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,出不去也进不来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing gets out, nothing gets in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.86,1:00:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拖延不了他们多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna be able to stall these guys much longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.69,1:00:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好在天亮前想出计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better have a plan before sunup.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.33,1:00:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,松动的地板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loose floorboards.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.94,1:00:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你在找的东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.44,1:00:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 底下还有吗？ - 没有 只有这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there any more down there? - No, that's it. Nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.65,1:00:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定把化学成份写在某个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gotta have the chemical composition written down somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.78,1:00:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那个东西会被花吸引{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if that thing's attracted to flowers…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.55,1:01:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就会爱这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.59,1:01:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？他们若找到这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they find this…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.19,1:01:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会杀死我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they'll kill us both.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.66,1:01:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.43,1:01:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清会造成细胞再生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the serum that causes cell regeneration.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.57,1:01:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.81,1:01:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们杀不死它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we can't kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.91,1:01:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪或砍头都不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if you're talking about shooting it or cutting its head off.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.18,1:01:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它太大只了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too big.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.92,1:01:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但若内部器官有足够的伤害 或许可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if there's enough damage to the internal organs, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.99,1:01:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.09,1:01:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇的器官又细又长 因为它是长管状的 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The snake's organs are long and thin because of its tubular shape, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.50,1:01:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们摧毁得够多它就不可能痊愈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we destroy enough of them, there's no way it can heal.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.81,1:01:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就是把它活埋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either that or burying it alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.74,1:01:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说这很容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I didn't say this was gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.58,1:02:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清就这么多 实在不合理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just doesn't make sense that this would be all of the serum.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.59,1:02:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫达克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.13,1:02:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不想让莫达克拿走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't want Murdoch getting it…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.03,1:02:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以把大部份都藏在别处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so he would hide the bulk of it someplace else.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.66,1:02:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是莫达克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Murdoch?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.77,1:02:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫达克就是出资造成这场梦魇的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murdoch's the one who financed this nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.82,1:02:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要把它收起来以防万一 - 我们该睡了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna put this away just in case. - We should get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.06,1:02:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.56,1:02:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少有人爽到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least somebody's having fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.37,1:03:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.87,1:03:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.48,1:03:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它嗅觉好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How good is his smell?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.28,1:03:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么好 但这是浓缩液{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that great, but this stuff is pure concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.10,1:03:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出去一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stepping out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.87,1:04:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.37,1:04:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.71,1:05:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么计划？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.34,1:05:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 小子？我没有计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, kid? I don't have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.68,1:05:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想时候到了就行动吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess just be ready to move when I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.79,1:05:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一我不在了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I'm not here…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.22,1:05:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就带她走 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you bring her with you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.23,1:05:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.73,1:05:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那个东西会被花吸引{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if that thing's attracted to flowers…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.54,1:05:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就会爱这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.69,1:06:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿曼达 有什么计划？ - 我还在想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amanda, what's the plan? - I'm thinking, I'm thinking, I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.66,1:06:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿曼达 有什么计划？ - 我在想！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amanda, what's the plan? - I'm thinking!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.70,1:06:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要我怎样？ - 不要迁怒我 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want me to do, huh? - Don't take it out on me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.23,1:06:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚失去了三个朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just lost three of my friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.42,1:06:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是…你看 这是血清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is… Look. It's the serum.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.76,1:06:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定是放在这里保持阴凉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have kept it in here to keep it cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.19,1:06:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 现在我们找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Now we've found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.30,1:06:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要回营地就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we gotta do is get back to the camp.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.53,1:06:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.04,1:06:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.52,1:07:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.25,1:07:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道往哪儿走 - 总之…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't even know where we're going. - Well, just…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.92,1:07:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会有什么损失？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we got to lose, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.42,1:07:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边？ - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This way? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.32,1:07:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你失去了几个朋友？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many friends have you lost?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.09,1:07:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没空聊那个 这不是我的任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't really talk about that right now. It's not my mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.59,1:07:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边 - 你确定？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This way. - You sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.80,1:07:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确定 - 阿曼达！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Amanda!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.33,1:07:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有血清 我们找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the serum. We actually… We found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.67,1:07:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it, take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.44,1:08:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么问题？ - 计划改变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, what's the problem? - There's been a change in plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.47,1:08:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要自己去 - 把袋子给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be going alone. - Give him the bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.81,1:08:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 袋子给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, hand me the bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.58,1:08:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿曼达 袋子给他 - 你闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amanda, give him the bag. - Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.11,1:08:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你退后 - 我们有你老板要的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You, hey, back off. - We have what your boss asked for.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.88,1:08:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们找到你老板要的东西 - 把袋子给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We found what your boss wants. - Give him the bag. Give him the bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.85,1:08:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退后 - 我们找到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back off. - We found it in the…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.32,1:08:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快把袋子给我 - 阿曼达 袋子给他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hand me the bag now. - Amanda, give him the bag!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.36,1:08:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.36,1:08:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.56,1:08:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.93,1:09:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？ - 你快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Go, run.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.77,1:09:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？不要！ - 你快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? No! - Run. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.00,1:09:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我走 - 快！快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come with me. - Go! Run, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.25,1:10:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到您 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to see you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.85,1:10:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.29,1:10:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 回屋里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, back inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.13,1:10:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拿水给那女孩喝 她抽筋了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need water for the girl. She's having convulsions.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.83,1:10:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我看着他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine, I'll watch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.53,1:10:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 路上还好吗？ - 糟透了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How was the drive, sir? - Terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.24,1:10:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有我该知道的事吗？ - 没有 一切都很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there anything I should know about? - No, sir, everything is good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.15,1:10:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.02,1:10:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦席里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vasile?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.52,1:11:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿做什么？ 我叫你干掉那个女的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here? I told you to take care of the girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.79,1:11:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走散了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got split up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.30,1:11:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那条蛇差点害死我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That snake of yours almost killed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.90,1:11:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.77,1:11:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又留下烂摊子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're just another loose end.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.14,1:11:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有预感你会这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a feeling that's what you would do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.01,1:11:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我谈了新合约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I cut a new deal…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.48,1:11:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对方愿意付我两倍的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with someone who will pay twice what you pay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.52,1:11:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金 你派上用场了 准备开始清理门户吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene, this is what I pay you for. Time to start cleaning house.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.43,1:11:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.87,1:11:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是他说的新伙伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm the new partner he was telling you about.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.34,1:11:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们讲好条件了 - 很抱歉 莫达克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But we had a deal. - I'm deeply sorry, Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.24,1:11:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是很好的条件 - 开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A very good deal. - Shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.81,1:12:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.68,1:12:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.68,1:12:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在等什么？开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for? Shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.60,1:12:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 我带你出去 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get you out of here. We gotta go, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.79,1:12:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,扶她上吉普车 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her to the car. Get her to the Jeep. Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.46,1:12:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move, move. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.53,1:13:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.73,1:13:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想不太好 - 好吧 跟我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I don't think so. - Okay, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.56,1:13:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.56,1:14:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们快离开这里 - 没那么快 阿曼达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta get out of here. Come on. - Not so fast, Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.37,1:14:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫达克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.94,1:14:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是想杀你 你早就死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wanted to kill you, you would already be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.54,1:14:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是全自动武器 你打算冒险吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is a fully automatic weapon. Are you prepared to take the risk?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.25,1:14:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 试试看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, try me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.52,1:14:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我要的东西给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me what I came for.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.15,1:14:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那个闲功夫 那些蛇还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time for this. The snakes are alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.66,1:14:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些蛇？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snakes?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.22,1:14:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得创造了一条会再生的蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter created a snake that would regenerate.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.49,1:14:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以血清奏效了 - 威胁也加倍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then the serum works. - The threat has doubled.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.60,1:14:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真麻烦 但那不是当务之急{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's disturbing, but not of immediate concern.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.00,1:14:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.97,1:14:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来谈条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.74,1:14:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的命换血清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lives for the serum.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.24,1:14:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说话算话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a man of my word.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.25,1:14:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.88,1:14:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.19,1:14:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give it to him. Give it to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.39,1:15:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 把你该死的血清拿去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Take your bloody serum.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.64,1:15:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们救了我的命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.44,1:15:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在逃命去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have yours. Now go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.75,1:15:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.52,1:15:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.09,1:15:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.13,1:15:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要来了 动作快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming, come on. Come on, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.63,1:16:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了！成功了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It works! It works!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.25,1:18:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是五分钟没回来 就不会回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm not back in five minutes, I'm not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.90,1:19:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.33,1:20:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下地狱吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can rot in hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.76,1:20:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.03,1:20:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克森 过来 - 好 我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jackson, come here. - Yeah, here, here, here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.90,1:20:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 钥匙拿去 你开车 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, take the keys. You drive. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.34,1:20:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪 那是什么？ - 是大蟒蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God, what is that? - It's the anaconda.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.28,1:20:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.49,1:21:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.96,1:21:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.91,1:21:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个丢出窗外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, get rid of this. Throw it out the window.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.78,1:21:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 趴下！ - 趴下…！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Down! - Get down, down, down!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.25,1:21:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 你没事吧？海瑟 趴下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda. Amanda, are you okay? Heather, stay down. Down.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.48,1:21:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 握住方向盘！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, take the wheel!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.81,1:22:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 快握住方向盘！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, take the damn wheel!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.82,1:22:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,握住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.33,1:22:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.23,1:22:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我握住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.90,1:22:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克森！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackson!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.05,1:23:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛看路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes on the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.94,1:23:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克森 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jackson. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.05,1:23:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.28,1:23:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快啊 杰克森 - 我在试啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry, Jackson. - I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.79,1:24:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你还怎么再生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see you try and regenerate from that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.09,1:24:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧 - 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's get out of here. - Let's go.
